{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "def change_base(x: int, base: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Converts a decimal integer x to its string representation in the specified base.\n    The target base is assumed to be between 2 and 9.\n    >>> change_base(8, 3)\n    '22'\n    >>> change_base(8, 2)\n    '1000'\n    >>> change_base(7, 2)\n    '111'\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n\n    digits = []\n    while x > 0:\n        remainder = x % base\n        digits.append(str(remainder))\n        x //= base\n\n    return \"\".join(digits[::-1])"}
